MODIFICATIONS
-------------
This is a modified derivative of CRIDP's work, as required by section 4(b) of
the Apache License. Nearly every remaining file has been changed, and the
changes are substantial rather than incidental:

  - Retargeted from 868 MHz (SX1276, FSK) to 2.4 GHz (AT86RF231, O-QPSK).
  - The Atlantic/Cozy heating support, the 868 MHz 1W remote, the Other2W
    scan and discovery experiments, the SX1276 helpers, the system table, the
    remote map, the OLED display, the web server and the MQTT handler have all
    been removed.
  - Added: a multi-key store held in NVS, a network console with OTA, a boot
    guard that rolls back a bad image, and the skylight command set.

The per-file Apache licence headers that CRIDP applied were consolidated into
this file and LICENSE. Section 4 of the Apache License requires that the
licence be distributed, that copyright and attribution notices be retained in
the source, and that modified files be marked; it does not require the header
comment in each file, which the licence's appendix offers as a convention. The
notices are retained here instead. Per-file history is in the git log.

